<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/eng@/~part_III__cl_25__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/eng@/~part_III__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/eng@> .
